	<!--                              EN: ancient mechanoid stasis container -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Cluster.label>ancient mechanoid stasis container</APM_MechanoidContainer_Cluster.label>
	<!--                                    EN: A heavy container equipped with autonomous activity-maintenance systems and archaic telemetry screens. Judging by the internal sensors, the mechanoid sealed inside was isolated from the hive mind immediately after its creation. The device is in deep preservation mode. Its mechanisms do not respond to external access codes, but the isolation saved the machine from forced deactivation. By breaking open this container, one can attempt to seize control of the forgotten mechanoid contained within. -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Cluster.description>A heavy container equipped with autonomous activity-maintenance systems and archaic telemetry screens. Judging by the internal sensors, the mechanoid sealed inside was isolated from the hive mind immediately after its creation. The device is in deep preservation mode. Its mechanisms do not respond to external access codes, but the isolation saved the machine from forced deactivation. By breaking open this container, one can attempt to seize control of the forgotten mechanoid contained within.</APM_MechanoidContainer_Cluster.description>
