	<!--                             EN: mechanoid stasis container -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.label>mechanoid stasis container</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.label>
	<!--                                   EN: A specialized stasis container designed for the safe storage of mechanoids. Placing a mechanoid inside completely severs its active neural link with the mechanitor and puts its systems into deep suspended animation. In this state, the machine consumes no power and does not occupy the mechanitor's bandwidth, freeing up valuable network resources. The container allows you to keep an assault or worker squad in reserve, ready for deployment at a moment's notice without risking network overload. -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.description>A specialized stasis container designed for the safe storage of mechanoids. Placing a mechanoid inside completely severs its active neural link with the mechanitor and puts its systems into deep suspended animation. In this state, the machine consumes no power and does not occupy the mechanitor's bandwidth, freeing up valuable network resources. The container allows you to keep an assault or worker squad in reserve, ready for deployment at a moment's notice without risking network overload.</APM_MechanoidContainer_Player.description>
