	<!--                              EN: abandoned mechanoid stasis container -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Ancient.label>abandoned mechanoid stasis container</APM_MechanoidContainer_Ancient.label>
	<!--                                    EN: A stasis container of human make, left running long enough that whoever built it is no longer around to say what is inside. The storage bay reads as occupied and the preservation cycle is still turning over on the last of its reserves. Breaking the seal will wake whatever is in there, and the neural link it once answered to is long dead, so a mechanitor should be able to claim it. -->
	<APM_MechanoidContainer_Ancient.description>A stasis container of human make, left running long enough that whoever built it is no longer around to say what is inside. The storage bay reads as occupied and the preservation cycle is still turning over on the last of its reserves. Breaking the seal will wake whatever is in there, and the neural link it once answered to is long dead, so a mechanitor should be able to claim it.</APM_MechanoidContainer_Ancient.description>
